  {
   "id": 640231,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The adrenal medulla secretes two types of hormones. Identify what is secreted and describe their functions.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1248423,
     "content_html": "They secrete cortisol and aldosterone, which increase heart rate, breathing rate, muscle contractions, blood pressure, and blood glucose as short-term stress response."
    },
    {
     "id": 1248422,
     "content_html": "They secrete epinephrine and norepinephrine, which increase heart rate, breathing rate, muscle contractions, blood pressure, and blood glucose as long-term stress response."
    },
    {
     "id": 1248421,
     "content_html": "They secrete cortisol and aldosterone, which increase heart rate, breathing rate, muscle contractions, blood pressure, and blood glucose as long-term stress response."
    },
